    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      537.61,
      538.25,
      635.23
    ],
    "text": "Several spells of showers will occur in Western, Sabaragamuwa and North-western province and in Kandy, Nuwara-Eliya, Galle and Matara districts. Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in Uva province and in Ampara and Batticaloa districts after 2.00 p.m.",
