  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      638.89,
      380.3,
      660.46
    ],
    "text": "Mainly dry weather will prevail over the other areas of the island.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      6.0,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      58.56,
      664.24,
      538.29,
      786.82
    ],
    "text": "Fairly strong winds of about (30-40) kmph can be expected at times over Western slopes of the Central hills, Northern, North-central, North-western and Southern provinces and in Trincomalee District. The general public is kindly requested to take adequate precautions to minimize damage caused by temporary localized strong winds and lightning during thundershowers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
